roduct="{&quot;id&quot;:6966395600961,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Ultimate Subscription&quot;,&quot;handle&quot;:&quot;ultimate-subscription&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;\u003cdiv class=\&quot;p-rich_text_section\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\&quot;utf-8\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cp class=\&quot;p1\&quot;\u003e\u003cspan style=\&quot;color: rgb(234, 114, 160);\&quot;\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e*[Special offer for first-time subscribers!] Get 50% off your first month + a FREE Pumpkin Spice Box Set when you sign up for this subscription tier. Hurry, while supplies last!\u003c\/i\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\&quot;p1\&quot;\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\&quot;color: rgb(234, 114, 160);\&quot;\u003eNote: The free box does NOT include the monthly headers, days of the week, and date-dot planner sticker sheets that were previously available for purchase as part of the full Pumpkin Spice Box Set on our website. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\&quot;p1\&quot;\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDecember theme: Snail Mail\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade for stationery lovers who journal, plan, collect, and decorate! This box has everything you need to keep your journaling practice creative and cute. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery month, you'll receive all the stickers and stationery from every other subscription tier combined into one illustrated collector's box - plus washi tapes, an enamel pin, and a pack of bonus die-cuts you won't find anywhere else. It is by far the best value and our most popular tier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\&quot;p-rich_text_section\&quot;\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\&quot;c-mrkdwn__br\&quot;\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYour Ultimate Subscription Box includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul class=\&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet\&quot;\u003e\n